al-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn/space/api/box/stream/download/authcode/?code=YWNkOGExNmU5ZTYzYmU1NTIzMjEzNWMxZmFkYWZlNWNfNzliYjU1MjUzMGM5NzdmNjNlY2JlZjE3NTc2Mjk2NTJfSUQ6NzY2MDA0MzU5MDE3MzM3OTUzMl8xNzgzNDk0MDM3OjE3ODM0OTc2MzdfVjM" mime="image/png" scale="1.000000" src="CzXSbgbrkoYAYyxyxFpcnWljnuf" width="169" /><p align="center">08-pose-panel.png</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>导演台空间</b><br /><b>机位编辑</b></p></td><td><p>操作：点左侧机位，切换到「机位视角」，调整机位位置、注视目标、视野角度。<br />输入：机位、坐标、FOV。<br />输出：镜头构图变化。<br />边界：没有选中机位时不能截图；切换机位不丢失已有角色。</p></td><td><img name="image9.png" height="117" href="https://internal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn/space/api/box/stream/download/authcode/?code=NWU2MmU3Y2NjZmMzMjE1MmRmYTY4YjZiMDI0ZGYyM2RfNDg4ZWIyYWZmNTc3OTk2OTZlNzcwNWY0M2NiYTA2NzBfSUQ6NzY2MDA0MzU5MDY2Nzg4MTQ0MF8xNzgzNDk0MDM3OjE3ODM0OTc2MzdfVjM" mime="image/png" scale="1.000000" src="J72vbwO2uoso1QxxGD3ciytZnbm" width="169" /><p align="center">09-camera-panel.png</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>导演台空间</b><br /><b>机位截图</b></p></td><td><p>操作：在机位面板点「摄像机截图」，生成当前机位预览，可清空或发送到画布。<br />输入：当前机位画面。<br />输出：截图列表。<br />边界：截图失败时保留场景；没有截图时「发送到画布」不可用。</p></td><td><img name="image10.png" height="117" href="https://internal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn/space/api/box/stream/download/authcode/?code=OGY3MGM5N2M5N2JkZjg4MGM0ZjMwY2VmMmZlMGE4NzBfNmY4YjUyNWVkMDgwMjE1MTYyNWI3NmRkYjYyMGI2NTdfSUQ6NzY2MDA0MzU4OTgyOTM2NDcwMl8xNzgzNDk0MDM3OjE3ODM0OTc2MzdfVjM" mime="image/png" scale="1.000000" src="Mp00b33O1o59voxtoqOcrCnVnlc" width="169" /><p align="center">10-camera-screenshot-list.png</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><b>导演台空间</b><br /><b>视图工具</b></p></td><td><p>操作：用底部工具切换移动、旋转、添加图片、添加几何体、添加摄像机、网格、全屏等。<br />输入：工具按钮。<br />输出：当前编辑模式变化。<br />边界：正在输入数字时不触发画布快捷键。</p></td><td><img name="image3.png" height="117" href="https://internal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn/space/api/box/stream/download/authcode/?code=Y2IyYTQzMDNlNThjMmQzY2U2NzRhMTY3ZmZmNDVmNDhfYzY5N2Y2YzRmNDU4MDA3ZDQzMzI4MGI5ZDE0YTYzNzRfSUQ6NzY2MDA0MzU4OTA4MzE1NTQwOF8xNzgzNDk0MDM3OjE3ODM0OTc2MzdfVjM" mime="image/png" scale="1.000000" src="X1rCbFGMroB6BZxjGdWcFPxznFW" width="169" /><p align="center">03-director-space-full.png</p></td></tr></tbody></table>